Read AGENTS.md before changing this repo.

`WalletServicer.encrypt` encrypts `str(card)` (protobuf text format), not `SerializeToString()`. Decrypt returns that same text. Do not hand-edit `wallet_pb2.py` or `wallet_pb2_grpc.py`.
